Description: Quarto workflow, scaffolded with qproj, for rebuilding the
    RecWaterVirome manuscript figures from frozen, provenance-checked
    inputs. It builds five main figures, four supplementary figures,
    Table 1 and two data workbooks, and copies them into a review
    candidate bundle. Every displayed number is checked against the
    shared definition table or its source. With the analysis version
    analysis-v2026.09.28.1 the local community results (TSEs,
    composition, alpha and beta diversity, cross-omics tests, host
    visibility) are computed here from the migrated SQLite snapshot and
    amplicon tables; the function, VF-model and global-reference
    modules read archived results of the source project, and no new
    scientific method is introduced.
